WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.940
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:36.190 --> 01:38.090
Women are all monsters.

01:38.090 --> 01:40.600
Once, women ate men's innards...

01:40.600 --> 01:43.120
...used them as toys, and
sucked them dry of all life.

01:45.630 --> 01:48.100
They have repeatedly
pillaged and plundered.

01:48.100 --> 01:51.440
They have forced
hard labor to oppress us.

01:51.440 --> 01:56.040
That horror is about to
attack our empire once again.

01:56.040 --> 01:58.250
These are the forms
of our hated enemy

01:58.250 --> 02:00.820
and of our dear
comrades' sacrifices.

02:00.820 --> 02:02.680
Even those who miraculously survive

02:02.680 --> 02:05.780
are left terribly scarred by women.

02:09.320 --> 02:12.660
However the time has come
to repay them for those

02:12.660 --> 02:14.460
long years of humiliation
and oppression!

02:16.000 --> 02:18.300
My comrades! My brothers!

02:18.300 --> 02:23.200
Now is the time to prove the
manhood of our empire of Tarak!

02:23.200 --> 02:27.640
This fatherland our great
forefather Grand Pa guided us to!

02:27.640 --> 02:30.910
We will supersede the holy
land that we are proud of

02:30.910 --> 02:33.950
and once again return the
pride of men into these hands.

02:33.950 --> 02:36.220
For today, at this moment,

02:36.220 --> 02:39.410
we have gained a new power!

02:42.720 --> 02:45.760
In other words, this means that
we have reached the time

02:45.760 --> 02:47.360
when we clamp down
the fist of justice

02:47.360 --> 02:49.200
upon our horrible nemesis, women!

02:49.200 --> 02:52.100
I wish I hadn't said that...

02:52.100 --> 02:55.040
Hey, look at this!

02:55.040 --> 02:58.710
We polish these parts with our
hearts and souls every day.

02:58.710 --> 03:02.010
Can you believe that someone
has finally arrived

03:02.010 --> 03:04.550
saying that he'll bring
us a complete Vanguard

03:04.550 --> 03:06.210
with this part in it?

03:07.480 --> 03:09.420
That guy's name is...

03:09.420 --> 03:12.620
...the one and only Hibiki Tokai!

03:12.620 --> 03:14.720
You did say it, right?

03:14.720 --> 03:18.430
That you'd grab a Vanguard
that we third class citizens

03:18.430 --> 03:21.600
never get to see
in all of our lifetimes.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.900
Oh, what's wrong?

03:22.900 --> 03:24.630
I don't hear anything.

03:24.630 --> 03:29.340
You can't possibly be saying now
that those were all lies, can ya?

03:29.340 --> 03:32.370
Mr. Hibiki's known to say
wonderful things all the time

03:32.370 --> 03:33.810
so you can't possibly...

03:33.810 --> 03:35.410
I'm not lying!

03:35.410 --> 03:37.580
F-Fine!

03:37.580 --> 03:38.980
I'll do it!

03:38.980 --> 03:40.470
Did everyone hear that?

03:44.290 --> 03:45.810
I'm such an idiot...

03:46.690 --> 03:49.560
I get so hotheaded so quickly...

03:49.560 --> 03:51.190
Sheesh...

03:51.190 --> 03:53.290
Dammit...

03:53.290 --> 03:54.460
No...

03:54.460 --> 03:56.460
I'm rotten but I'm still a guy!

03:56.460 --> 03:58.930
And Hibiki the man
never breaks his word!

04:04.410 --> 04:05.570
I swear on this day

04:05.570 --> 04:08.080
that we will destroy the
sinful women of Mejale

04:08.080 --> 04:10.370
and the bravery of men will triumph!

04:11.110 --> 04:13.680
Well, we are only
third class citizens.

04:13.680 --> 04:14.650
No...

04:14.650 --> 04:16.720
Don't do anything stupid.

04:16.720 --> 04:18.920
If we sit quietly and make these parts

04:18.920 --> 04:21.590
we'll at least be fed
for the rest of our lives.

04:21.590 --> 04:23.320
Don't be hotheaded, shorty.

04:23.320 --> 04:26.060
No matter what you do,
you can't move up in class.

04:26.060 --> 04:28.230
It's not that I'm hotheaded.

04:28.230 --> 04:31.030
But all the blood in me is shouting!

04:31.030 --> 04:34.400
That there's something
else out there...

04:34.400 --> 04:35.740
It's just impossible.

04:35.740 --> 04:37.140
Think about where you stand.

04:37.140 --> 04:40.940
Only guys who get hotheaded easily
have silly dreams like that.

04:40.940 --> 04:42.610
Prove it to us.

04:42.610 --> 04:44.950
Not with just words,
but with actions!

04:44.950 --> 04:46.850
All right, I'll do it!

04:46.850 --> 04:48.850
Power from each and every one of you

04:48.850 --> 04:52.350
will build the future of our empire!

04:52.350 --> 04:55.090
The ship that has led
us to this fatherland,

04:55.090 --> 04:57.160
the Ikazuchi, has been revived.

04:57.160 --> 04:59.290
And the young men
of the third generation

04:59.290 --> 05:04.130
are its new officers, holding
the future of Tarak in their hands.

05:04.130 --> 05:07.640
We no longer have anything to fear!

05:07.640 --> 05:10.810
In order to repay Grand Pa and
the great first generation,

05:10.810 --> 05:13.740
who cultivated this land,

05:13.740 --> 05:15.840
the time for the second
and third generations

05:15.840 --> 05:18.180
to combine their powers into one

05:18.180 --> 05:21.150
is the time when our long
awaited dream will come true!

05:23.180 --> 05:24.820
The ship of our hearts.

05:24.820 --> 05:28.590
I'm sure you all feel the new
breath of the Ikazuchi as well.

05:28.590 --> 05:30.460
Look and praise!

05:30.460 --> 05:32.890
This is the flagship
of our Tarak Imperial Army.

05:32.890 --> 05:35.020
The grand shape of the Ikazuchi!

05:37.270 --> 05:39.200
You third generation of Tarak

05:39.200 --> 05:41.540
born to board the new Ikazuchi.

05:41.540 --> 05:44.370
The first graduates of the officer academy!

05:44.370 --> 05:45.610
Congratulations!

05:45.610 --> 05:49.280
You are those who have been
properly passed down

05:49.280 --> 05:52.110
the genes of the eight members
of the first generation

05:52.110 --> 05:54.980
including our forefather Grand Pa!

05:58.150 --> 05:59.990
I can't stand all this dust.

05:59.990 --> 06:02.150
Hey, not over there! Over here!

06:03.520 --> 06:05.290
As you may know

06:05.290 --> 06:09.360
our mission is to end the piracy
of the women who have been

06:09.360 --> 06:11.230
appearing in our realm as of late.

06:11.230 --> 06:14.600
But never forget that you are
always on the battlefield.

06:14.600 --> 06:17.040
- Work and don't get caught off-guard
- Oh, this way?

06:17.040 --> 06:19.040
To prepare for the coming operation!

06:19.040 --> 06:20.060
Roger!

06:22.780 --> 06:25.040
Sheesh, this is a huge ship...

06:26.580 --> 06:28.980
I'm not just going in blind.

06:28.980 --> 06:32.350
I've done my background research.

06:32.350 --> 06:33.720
No palmprint match.

06:33.720 --> 06:35.790
Re-enter within 30 seconds.

06:35.790 --> 06:36.790
W-What?

06:36.790 --> 06:38.190
The time has come!

06:38.190 --> 06:40.800
We can't wait for departure time!

06:40.800 --> 06:43.030
Right, men?

06:43.030 --> 06:45.730
No way! It's still 2 hours early!

06:45.730 --> 06:48.340
- Stations, men!
- That crazy minister!

06:48.340 --> 06:50.040
10... 9...

06:50.040 --> 06:50.910
- Oh, come on!
- 8...

06:50.910 --> 06:52.140
- Why?
- 7...

06:52.140 --> 06:54.540
- I didn't screw anything up!
- 6... 5...

06:54.540 --> 06:56.870
4... 3... 2...

07:04.090 --> 07:06.120
How's that? Piece of cake!

07:06.120 --> 07:09.260
Ikazuchi! Ikazuchi!

07:09.260 --> 07:10.960
Your voices have been heard.

07:10.960 --> 07:13.020
I will now answer your voices!

07:25.140 --> 07:27.410
Huh? It's not here...

07:27.410 --> 07:28.680
Where is it?

07:28.680 --> 07:29.810
Not this one...

07:29.810 --> 07:31.050
Or this one...

07:31.050 --> 07:34.140
Maybe they didn't use the part
because they saw the scratch?

07:36.220 --> 07:38.720
Oh, you are here, partner!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.810
You're looking rather huge.

07:43.020 --> 07:45.830
I'll take you home right now!

07:45.830 --> 07:47.690
Launch the Ikazuchi!

07:52.630 --> 07:53.830
What's this?

07:59.040 --> 08:00.030
What is this?

08:05.410 --> 08:07.750
The time of departure has arrived.

08:14.790 --> 08:16.660
No way... It's flying?

08:16.660 --> 08:17.890
Cheers!

08:17.890 --> 08:19.560
Oh, I'm so excited...

08:19.560 --> 08:21.260
You're piloting a Vanguard, right?

08:21.260 --> 08:23.260
You want to make kids
after this mission's over?

08:23.260 --> 08:25.830
Oh, a kid with you?
Not a bad idea!

08:25.830 --> 08:28.370
Duero, you'll be
at headquarters, right?

08:28.370 --> 08:31.040
You should be able to pick and
choose where you want to go!

08:31.040 --> 08:33.980
I hear he submitted his
future plans completely blank.

08:33.980 --> 08:34.980
What?

08:34.980 --> 08:37.780
Hey, is everyone
having a good time?

08:37.780 --> 08:39.980
This is our company's new item.

08:39.980 --> 08:42.750
It's a special nutrition
tablet we formulated.

08:42.750 --> 08:44.350
I can't say this too loudly...

08:44.350 --> 08:47.390
...but the quality of the ingredients
is far superior to other pellets!

08:47.390 --> 08:49.420
Here, as a sign of friendship...

08:49.420 --> 08:50.790
No, we're...

08:50.790 --> 08:52.830
Sorry, I'm full right now.

08:52.830 --> 08:55.460
Oh, that's a shame...

08:55.460 --> 08:57.400
You may never be
able to eat this again.

08:57.400 --> 08:59.500
Hey, both of you over there!

08:59.500 --> 09:01.740
You want to try this out?

09:01.740 --> 09:03.640
I recommend this especially to you.

09:03.640 --> 09:07.140
- Who's he?
- The third head of Garsus Foods.

09:07.140 --> 09:10.880
Let's just say that our stomachs
are being filled by him.

09:10.880 --> 09:13.080
I feel some heartburn coming...

09:13.080 --> 09:16.450
Gentlemen, pay attention to the
silver screen in front of you.

09:21.960 --> 09:23.690
Pierce, stab, slay.

09:23.690 --> 09:26.060
With all of these
all-purpose accessories

09:26.060 --> 09:28.600
the Tsukumo version
is in itself a weapon.

09:28.600 --> 09:32.170
It easily repels
the bullets of weak enemies

09:32.170 --> 09:35.170
and slams the fist of justice
into our horrible nemesis.

09:35.170 --> 09:36.940
The leading soldier of our empire

09:36.940 --> 09:40.510
the Tsukumo version
of the Van-type fighter.

09:40.510 --> 09:42.880
To the sky, the sea, the
fields, the mountains...

09:42.880 --> 09:46.210
There is nothing to fear in
front of the pride of the empire!

09:46.210 --> 09:48.950
The Tsukumo version Van-type fighter.

09:48.950 --> 09:53.650
The dawn of Tarak
is right in front of us!

09:53.650 --> 09:55.490
It's so rad!

09:55.490 --> 09:57.890
H-How unfashionable

09:57.890 --> 09:59.830
How about a huge round of applause

09:59.830 --> 10:03.090
for our fleet of Tsukumo
version Van-type fighters!

10:11.240 --> 10:13.170
Hey, someone's hanging off it!

10:13.170 --> 10:15.910
Isn't that a third-class citizen?

10:15.910 --> 10:18.580
W-What are you doing? Get him!

10:18.580 --> 10:19.610
Hey, you!

10:19.610 --> 10:21.280
How'd you sneak in?

10:22.580 --> 10:23.990
Dammit, don't touch me!

10:23.990 --> 10:25.290
Quiet down!

10:25.290 --> 10:27.090
Go for it, shorty!

10:27.090 --> 10:28.460
Hey, entertainment!

10:28.460 --> 10:30.660
Stupid.

10:30.660 --> 10:32.720
Who just called me shorty?

10:34.360 --> 10:36.520
Let go! Let me go!

10:39.170 --> 10:40.740
Guard fleet is approaching.

10:40.740 --> 10:43.600
Get into a half-moon formation
with the Ikazuchi in the center.

10:43.600 --> 10:45.610
The captain has arrived!

10:45.610 --> 10:49.710
Sheesh, that ceremony was all a waste!

10:49.710 --> 10:51.380
It's the guard ship Maboroshi, sir.

10:51.380 --> 10:53.250
They want instructions
concerning the match.

10:53.250 --> 10:55.080
The exhibition is canceled!

10:55.080 --> 10:57.390
Send all ships to their orbital paths!

10:57.390 --> 10:57.990
Roger!

10:57.990 --> 10:59.490
That brat...

10:59.490 --> 11:01.580
I won't let him go easily...

11:08.230 --> 11:09.160
Damn you!

11:09.160 --> 11:11.070
Don't stick me in some warehouse!

11:11.070 --> 11:12.830
If you're gonna kill me,
kill me now!

11:12.830 --> 11:17.240
That's a proper cell,
even though we use it as a warehouse.

11:17.240 --> 11:19.240
They decided on a public execution.

11:19.240 --> 11:21.210
You won't die easy.

11:21.210 --> 11:22.280
Hi-type #6!

11:22.280 --> 11:24.480
- Beep.
- Keep a good eye on him.

11:24.480 --> 11:27.210
Beep. Roger.

11:27.210 --> 11:31.150
My life's always turning against me...

11:31.150 --> 11:32.650
Hey, partner...

11:32.650 --> 11:34.960
Let me out of here...

11:34.960 --> 11:37.020
We were both born in a factory...

11:37.020 --> 11:39.430
So we're brothers, right? Right?

11:39.430 --> 11:40.090
Beep.

11:40.090 --> 11:43.100
- We are made of different materials.
- I have a good generator!

11:43.100 --> 11:46.670
- The term "brothers" is inappropriate.
- Let me out and I'll put it on you!

11:46.670 --> 11:47.570
Denied.

11:47.570 --> 11:50.370
The observed is making
an inappropriate request.

11:50.370 --> 11:53.370
Instigation of escape and
attempted bribery are crimes...

11:53.370 --> 11:54.110
Therefore...

11:54.110 --> 11:55.180
Therefore?

11:55.180 --> 11:56.200
Punishment.

11:58.710 --> 12:00.850
What the hell are you doing?
Who do you think I am?!

12:00.850 --> 12:03.620
Starting identity scan of the observed.

12:03.620 --> 12:05.890
- I'm not a guy who'd end up here!
- Observed is human, organic.

12:05.890 --> 12:07.420
- So please!
- Searching compiled data.

12:07.420 --> 12:10.960
Scan complete. You are...

12:10.960 --> 12:12.130
B-Beep.

12:12.130 --> 12:12.790
Beep!

12:15.200 --> 12:15.930
What?

12:15.930 --> 12:17.800
I thought I stopped the exhibition!

12:17.800 --> 12:19.330
- This isn't an exhibition!
- Mejale forces at 3 o'clock!

12:19.330 --> 12:21.800
- Women! It's an ambush!
- 3 mobile stars and a code red!

12:23.240 --> 12:24.340
Formation is broken!

12:24.340 --> 12:26.110
All ships, guard the Ikazuchi!

12:26.110 --> 12:28.810
The enemy powers are...

12:28.810 --> 12:30.110
Captain.

12:30.110 --> 12:32.250
It looks like we've caught a big one.

12:32.250 --> 12:34.480
Today is a lucky day, you know.

12:34.480 --> 12:36.350
Hurry! Run!

12:36.350 --> 12:38.820
Where did the information leak from?

12:38.820 --> 12:41.380
W-What now?

12:54.030 --> 12:55.400
Guard ship Hijiri is gone!

12:55.400 --> 12:56.870
The Maboroshi is down!

12:56.870 --> 12:59.070
Hull breach in the
Ikazuchi's new segment!

12:59.070 --> 13:00.140
How unfair.

13:00.140 --> 13:01.910
Using the background shots to hide...

13:01.910 --> 13:03.440
Keep level!

13:03.440 --> 13:04.380
Launch the Vanguards!

13:04.380 --> 13:06.250
Minister, most of them are trainees...

13:06.250 --> 13:09.150
If we lose without
using our latest weapons

13:09.150 --> 13:11.490
we have only shamed Grand Pa!

13:11.490 --> 13:13.190
All officer candidates!

13:13.190 --> 13:15.690
Now is the time to repay
our forefather Grand Pa!

13:15.690 --> 13:18.090
Each of you get to your places
and destroy the enemies!

13:21.230 --> 13:23.290
- #3, #4, go to 10 of 102.58!
- You over there, go to #12.

13:28.870 --> 13:30.240
Hey, what happened to Bart?

13:30.240 --> 13:31.710
Like I know!

13:31.710 --> 13:35.280
Gravity will now be nullified for
the departure of the Vanguards.

13:35.280 --> 13:36.440
Please be careful.

13:42.980 --> 13:44.720
Mechanical area has taken a hit!

13:44.720 --> 13:46.080
Firefighters, hurry!

13:47.450 --> 13:50.220
The motor for the Vanguard
runway has been cut off!

13:50.220 --> 13:52.060
I don't care! Just launch them!

13:52.060 --> 13:53.060
What?

13:53.060 --> 13:54.330
All prepped Vanguards!

13:54.330 --> 13:55.630
Go out at your own discretion!

14:17.250 --> 14:18.150
Eek!

14:18.150 --> 14:19.320
What are they?

14:19.320 --> 14:20.820
They're getting in my way!

14:20.820 --> 14:22.090
Don't worry about the Vanguards.

14:22.090 --> 14:23.390
Concentrate on the flagship.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.650
Roger!

14:28.160 --> 14:30.930
Don't underestimate the
knowledge of a mechanic.

14:30.930 --> 14:33.630
B-B-Beep...

14:33.630 --> 14:35.300
B-Beep...

14:35.300 --> 14:36.960
Bee...

14:41.880 --> 14:43.280
Mechanical area hull breach.

14:43.280 --> 14:44.940
Emergency walls activated.

14:48.180 --> 14:49.880
What's going on?

14:49.880 --> 14:51.720
I've gotta get out of here fast...

14:53.750 --> 14:55.290
Cargo bay gravity restored!

14:55.290 --> 14:57.150
We will now engage the enemy!

15:06.670 --> 15:07.960
That's a woman?

15:11.610 --> 15:12.970
I don't want to die!

15:21.250 --> 15:22.740
Stop!

15:27.050 --> 15:30.290
I can't die in a place like this!

15:34.900 --> 15:37.030
Minister! T-That's...

15:37.030 --> 15:40.270
Instead of living to become prisoners

15:40.270 --> 15:43.840
I must at least save
this new segment of the ship.

15:43.840 --> 15:46.440
Before everything
falls to female hands,

15:46.440 --> 15:48.170
I will cut off the old segment!

15:51.150 --> 15:51.910
What?

15:51.910 --> 15:52.980
The ship is splitting up!

15:52.980 --> 15:54.410
What's gonna happen to us?

16:09.660 --> 16:11.030
What's this?

16:14.270 --> 16:15.600
- A monster!
- H-Hold on!

16:15.600 --> 16:16.570
Wait!

16:19.240 --> 16:22.040
Wow, a real alien!

16:22.040 --> 16:24.270
A-Alien?

16:33.350 --> 16:35.090
I did it! It worked!

16:35.090 --> 16:36.580
First contact!

16:38.730 --> 16:39.830
See ya.

16:39.830 --> 16:41.630
Hey!

16:41.630 --> 16:42.630
Wait a minute!

16:42.630 --> 16:44.260
I haven't taken my photo!

16:47.500 --> 16:48.370
Now, over there.

16:48.370 --> 16:49.670
Gather in one place!

16:49.670 --> 16:52.110
If you do anything funny, we'll shoot!

16:52.110 --> 16:56.310
Even if it is a disinfectant,
I still can't get used to this smell.

16:56.310 --> 16:57.440
Where's Dita?

16:57.440 --> 17:00.150
She shot her beam
and charged into the wall!

17:00.150 --> 17:01.380
Thanks to that, we got...

17:01.380 --> 17:03.080
Hey, that hurts!

17:03.080 --> 17:05.020
My skin is delicate, you know!

17:05.020 --> 17:06.590
I can't help it!

17:06.590 --> 17:08.120
A nurse shouldn't say that.

17:08.120 --> 17:08.990
But...

17:08.990 --> 17:10.180
Hey, don't stop there!

17:15.560 --> 17:16.960
What is this?

17:16.960 --> 17:19.300
They haven't used this at all!

17:19.300 --> 17:22.540
This doesn't seem
to be the main bridge.

17:22.540 --> 17:24.440
Captain, this is Buzam.

17:24.440 --> 17:26.510
The men have split
the ship and withdrawn.

17:26.510 --> 17:28.130
We've taken control
of the sub-bridge.

17:29.110 --> 17:30.480
Oh my...

17:30.480 --> 17:32.650
What do we do?
I can't read this at all...

17:32.650 --> 17:33.780
Leave it to me.

17:33.780 --> 17:37.380
I brought this inter-pricko
thinking this would happen...

17:37.380 --> 17:39.190
Vice-captain,
I'll put one there too...

17:39.190 --> 17:40.690
Meia, how is it there?

17:40.690 --> 17:42.290
The men are all frozen.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.120
Throw them out.

17:43.120 --> 17:43.860
Roger.

17:43.860 --> 17:45.590
Vice-captain, you can read this?

17:45.590 --> 17:47.130
Nothing less from our elite one!

17:47.130 --> 17:49.720
Shoot, and I made this, too...

17:51.870 --> 17:54.470
I don't want my guts eaten up!

17:54.470 --> 17:55.800
Hey, Mr. Alien!

17:55.800 --> 17:57.500
Let's just sit and talk!

17:57.500 --> 17:59.400
Women are scary!

18:00.110 --> 18:02.740
The Mejale ship is approaching
the old segment!

18:02.740 --> 18:04.450
Data is being transfered!

18:04.450 --> 18:06.910
They've gotten started
on the takeover, huh?

18:06.910 --> 18:09.620
Prepare to fire
the space torpedo Muramasa!

18:09.620 --> 18:10.680
Impossible!

18:10.680 --> 18:14.460
Are you going to destroy
the old segment?

18:14.460 --> 18:19.190
If it is to fall to pirate hands,
I'll get rid of it with my own hands!

18:19.190 --> 18:21.180
You sure are persistent, woman!

18:22.960 --> 18:25.270
Hey, why are you running away?

18:25.270 --> 18:28.930
- I belong to a peaceful race!
- I don't get what she's saying!

18:32.370 --> 18:33.710
Don't get out of line.

18:33.710 --> 18:36.010
Get into the capsule!

18:36.010 --> 18:38.180
I'll go later.

18:38.180 --> 18:39.980
You can't just do what you want.

18:39.980 --> 18:41.120
I'll shoot if you disobey.

18:41.120 --> 18:43.280
No need to worry.

18:43.280 --> 18:44.610
I'm a doctor!

18:51.260 --> 18:53.960
Escape pods have been
launched from the old segment.

18:53.960 --> 18:56.360
Is that their way of pitying us?

18:56.360 --> 18:58.630
Why don't we ask for a compromise?

18:58.630 --> 19:00.130
Isn't the Muramasa ready yet?

19:00.130 --> 19:00.800
Minister!

19:00.800 --> 19:02.670
Determining coordinates of target!

19:05.370 --> 19:08.280
I was looking forward to a big one,

19:08.280 --> 19:09.440
but it's all junk!

19:09.440 --> 19:10.580
Jura!

19:10.580 --> 19:12.050
I'm going to look for Dita.

19:12.050 --> 19:12.810
Come with me.

19:12.810 --> 19:16.650
Sheesh, that's why I didn't
want to bring along a trainee!

19:16.650 --> 19:18.820
We're short enough on people as is.

19:18.820 --> 19:21.460
If you objected,
you should have said so earlier.

19:21.460 --> 19:23.390
I know... Sheesh...

19:23.390 --> 19:24.910
You want me to go, right?

19:32.100 --> 19:33.730
Oh my...

19:33.730 --> 19:35.700
A missile has locked onto us.

19:35.700 --> 19:36.570
What?

19:36.570 --> 19:38.510
Parfet, can you move the ship?

19:38.510 --> 19:39.610
That's impossible!

19:39.610 --> 19:41.880
The engine's still dead!

19:41.880 --> 19:42.580
Captain!

19:42.580 --> 19:44.010
I'm monitoring it from here.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.380
Losing the loot is a shame,

19:45.380 --> 19:46.470
but let's get out of here!

19:48.720 --> 19:49.520
Roger!

19:49.520 --> 19:50.780
Meia, did you copy?

19:50.780 --> 19:52.220
I've lost Dita!

19:52.220 --> 19:54.980
I'll rendezvous as soon as
I find her, so go ahead...

19:57.160 --> 19:58.190
Stay away! Don't touch me!

19:58.190 --> 19:59.690
Why?

19:59.690 --> 20:00.590
Dita!

20:00.590 --> 20:03.130
Look, she's chasing a man.

20:03.130 --> 20:04.790
That should do it.

20:06.770 --> 20:07.900
W-What?

20:07.900 --> 20:09.970
You see something interesting?

20:09.970 --> 20:12.010
Yes, I do.

20:12.010 --> 20:14.140
- Don't expect thanks.
- That's fine.

20:14.140 --> 20:16.410
Well, I guess I'll go now, too.

20:16.410 --> 20:18.070
He touched 5 girls!

20:21.150 --> 20:22.620
Starboard control has been lost!

20:22.620 --> 20:24.920
The pirate ship is
approaching the old segment!

20:24.920 --> 20:26.050
And the Muramasa?

20:26.050 --> 20:27.520
Still charging fuel!

20:27.520 --> 20:28.920
It's enough!

20:28.920 --> 20:31.250
Target the old segment
of the Ikazuchi and fire!

20:38.770 --> 20:40.370
Starting crew collection.

20:40.370 --> 20:42.540
300 seconds until missile arrival.

20:42.540 --> 20:43.800
BC!

20:43.800 --> 20:45.540
All crew other than me have escaped.

20:45.540 --> 20:47.540
Three in Meia's team haven't returned.

20:47.540 --> 20:49.380
We'll let them come back on the Dreads.

20:49.380 --> 20:50.540
You should return!

20:50.540 --> 20:51.200
Roger.

20:52.850 --> 20:53.880
Hey, wait

20:53.880 --> 20:54.870
Dita!

20:55.920 --> 20:57.320
Oh, Leader!

20:57.320 --> 20:58.450
What are you doing?

20:58.450 --> 21:00.520
Don't act independently from the team!

21:00.520 --> 21:01.490
I'm sorry.

21:02.890 --> 21:04.880
150 seconds until arrival.

21:07.060 --> 21:08.230
Meia, where are you?

21:08.230 --> 21:09.530
All three are all right.

21:09.530 --> 21:10.860
We'll leave now on the Dreads.

21:12.670 --> 21:13.770
My Vanguard...

21:13.770 --> 21:15.270
There it is!

21:15.270 --> 21:16.830
We did it, partner!

21:23.910 --> 21:26.410
All right, let's get outta here!

21:26.410 --> 21:27.180
But...

21:27.180 --> 21:29.550
How does this thing move?

21:29.550 --> 21:31.450
25 seconds until arrival!

21:31.450 --> 21:33.690
We can't avoid a direct hit!

21:33.690 --> 21:36.180
Hit or miss,
either way it was destined.

21:39.460 --> 21:40.450
Dita!

21:43.160 --> 21:45.600
I'm stuck and can't get out!

21:45.600 --> 21:46.660
13 seconds left!

21:47.730 --> 21:49.260
Move! Move!

21:50.770 --> 21:51.440
Dita!

21:51.440 --> 21:52.770
We can't wait!

21:53.910 --> 21:55.840
Someone, help me!

22:04.820 --> 22:06.510
We're losing mass!

22:08.460 --> 22:10.750
Now do you know, women?

22:17.860 --> 22:19.920
W-What the hell are you?

22:32.250 --> 22:37.850
Hey, you realized what the words,

22:37.850 --> 22:43.360
I really wanted to hear are, right?

22:43.360 --> 22:49.600
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

22:49.600 --> 22:59.910
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

22:59.910 --> 23:02.440
Hey, with all of my body.

23:02.440 --> 23:14.220
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

23:14.220 --> 23:25.830
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

23:25.830 --> 23:37.640
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

23:37.640 --> 23:51.510
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
